# Stage-3 RAG golden set. Tenants from seed_demo(seed=7): 0 = fjord, 1 = cinder, 2 = gable.
# Every tenant has the same six documents with different facts (core.synthetic.synthetic_documents),
# so a correct answer for one tenant is wrong for another. expected.fact names the fact whose value
# (looked up at run time for that tenant) the answer must contain.
